tinacloud(1) -- A CLI tool to interact with TinaCloud related services
======================================================================

## SYNOPSIS

`tinacloud` [command]

## DESCRIPTION

`tinacloud` allows the management of organisations, projects, and other
TinaCloud related actions from the CLI.

## OPTIONS

  * `auth`:
    Authenticate with TinaCloud

  * `org`:
    Interact with organizations

  * `project`:
    Interact with projects

  * `configure`:
    Configure a local Tina project

  * `completion`:
    Generate shell completion scripts

  * `-v`, `--version`:
    Print the current installed version

  * `-h`, `--help`:
    Print the help menu

## EXAMPLES

Sign in, then configure the TinaCMS project in the current directory:

	$ tinacloud auth login
	$ tinacloud configure

List the projects for an organisation:

	$ tinacloud project list --org-id <organization-id>

Print a machine-readable result:

	$ tinacloud org list --json

## SEE ALSO

tinacloud-auth-login(1), tinacloud-configure(1), tinacloud-org-list(1),
tinacloud-project-list(1), tinacloud-project-create(1)

